      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多次往返于水中和岸上需要极高的耐力和速度，\n这项竞技即使是看着也让人窒息——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a721640cf610d05dc4d33d2285d8ce8751230f8cb1ed7c2dd0da4b3d8ce3d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
